    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But that's just more struggle, Silas. More noise. You keep talking about protecting me, but what is there to protect? This hollow shell? If I could just... slip into that stillness, wouldn't that be the most merciful thing? To stop fighting the tide and just let the darkness take me? It seems so much more natural than this constant, exhausting effort to exist.",
